// (00951660 / 00951560 / 009517C0 / 009516D0 / 00951720 / 00927940 / 00521E30),
// the backslash-path lookup 009251F0, and the Cloud creators 004E9E40 /
// 004E9920. Evidence per claim in docs/ENTITY_IDENTITY.md.
